    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051116.0186\n\nHONG KONG, Nov. 16 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nGold price higher in Hong Kong -- Nov. 16\n\n\n\n\nThe gold price in Hong Kong rose 35 HK dollars at 4,351 HK dollars a tael Wednesday, according to the Bank of China (Hong Kong).\n\nThe gold price is equivalent to 471.33 US dollars a troy ounce, up 3.79 US dollars at Wednesday's exchange rate of one US dollar against 7.7490 HK dollars.",
